<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- What the app collects (for its account, nothing for ads nor tracking), and why it reads UserDefaults: its own settings (CA92.1) and the App Group shared with the widget and the Screen Time extensions (1C8F.1). Keep it in line with the privacy policy of the site. -->
